  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<h1>雅典娜（Athena）</h1>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔线\">\n<p style=\"display:inline\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://images.teamresourceful.com/r/I80VLV.svg?compress=false\" alt=\"由 Terrarium 制作\" width=\"155\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fstitch\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/indium\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://images.teamresourceful.com/r/dCVaUA.svg?compress=false\" alt=\"若无铟（Indium），则与钠（Sodium）不兼容\" width=\"234\" height=\"56\"></a></p>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔线\">\n<h2>📖简介📖</h2>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></div><p>雅典娜（Athena）是一款多功能、跨平台的烘焙模型加载器，内置了连接纹理支持。它针对每种类型采用独特的烘焙模型，以确保跨平台的最佳性能和兼容性。雅典娜的连接纹理方法（CTM）专门针对这些模型设计，以最小化不必要的计算并解决常见问题。此外，雅典娜支持自定义检查，例如为玻璃板提供特殊的垂直裁剪功能，以进一步增强其功能性。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.terrarium.earth%252fstitch\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/documentation/gitbook_vector.svg\" alt=\"GitBook\" height=\"56\"> </a></p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fterrarium\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;</a><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔线\">\n<h2>✨社交媒体✨</h2>\n<p style=\"display:inline\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutube.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/youtube-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"YouTube 频道\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/terrariumearth\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/twitch-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Twitch 频道\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftwitter.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/twitter-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Twitter 账号\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fkofi.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/kofi-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi 赞助\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord 社区\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fTerrarium\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/terrariumearth/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a></p>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"> 本模组的标志使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flucide.dev%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lucide 图标</a> 制作 <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></div>",
